  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">pwsbuilder</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-6668 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news\" id=\"post-6668\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/robert-mesrop-featured-demonstration-artist-at-the-guild-of-harwich-artists-10-14-meeting/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Robert Mesrop Featured Demonstration Artist at the Guild of Harwich Artists 10/14 Meeting.</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2023-10-11T13:05:28-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, October 11, 2023, 1:05 pm\">October 11, 2023</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The public is invited to the Guild of Harwich Artists general meeting on October 14th at 2pm at The 204, second floor Library. Address is 204 Sisson Roads, Harwich, 02645. <a href=\"/news/robert-mesrop-featured-demonstration-artist-at-the-guild-of-harwich-artists-10-14-meeting/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-6665 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news\" id=\"post-6665\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/martha-kempe-art-show-at-cape-cod-cooperative-bank-east-harwich/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"581\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Martha Kempe Art Show\" src=\"/media/archive/f59493c9517afb09fd287a0292798676797b525851d3ee85c106c4914f6d4fa4.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/martha-kempe-art-show-at-cape-cod-cooperative-bank-east-harwich/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Martha Kempe Art Show at Cape Cod Cooperative Bank (East Harwich)</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2023-10-11T13:00:50-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, October 11, 2023, 1:00 pm\">October 11, 2023</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>  Martha Kempe at her solo art show at the Cape Cod Cooperative Bank (East Harwich) for the month of October.  Her paintings can be seen during regular bank hours.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-6651 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news\" id=\"post-6651\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/carroll-peter-sivco-art-show-at-cape-cod-cooperative-bank/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"584\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Two people standing in front of a fireplace with paintings on the wall.\" src=\"/media/archive/6f2c8194584e2705b442f85b6116e791b04ff51517a1b56c609d50414d42a8aa.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/carroll-peter-sivco-art-show-at-cape-cod-cooperative-bank/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Carroll &amp; Peter Sivco Art Show at Cape Cod Cooperative Bank</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2023-09-12T16:19:08-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, September 12, 2023, 4:19 pm\">September 12, 2023</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Members Carroll &amp; Peter Sivco are currently showing their art at the Cape Cod Cooperative Bank in East Harwich through September.  Their expressive paintings are viewable during regular banking hours. <a href=\"/news/carroll-peter-sivco-art-show-at-cape-cod-cooperative-bank/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-6645 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news\" id=\"post-6645\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/guild-members-guests-annual-dinner-invitation/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"881\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A building with a sign that says food 400 east spirits.\" src=\"/media/archive/98b5d2d4f37163eedc2eeedbbaea37ad454100a27c30b9c08222d6b39c7865bf.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-members-guests-annual-dinner-invitation/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Members &amp; Guests Annual Dinner Invitation</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2023-09-08T11:40:28-04:00\" title=\"Friday, September 8, 2023, 11:40 am\">September 8, 2023</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>ANNUAL DINNER Invite</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-6639 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news\" id=\"post-6639\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/carroll-peter-sivco-art-show-cape-cod-cooperative-bank/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"584\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Two people standing in front of a fireplace with paintings on the wall.\" src=\"/media/archive/6f2c8194584e2705b442f85b6116e791b04ff51517a1b56c609d50414d42a8aa.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/carroll-peter-sivco-art-show-cape-cod-cooperative-bank/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Carroll &amp; Peter Sivco Art Show – Cape Cod Cooperative Bank</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2023-09-08T11:04:18-04:00\" title=\"Friday, September 8, 2023, 11:04 am\">September 8, 2023</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Carroll and Peter Sivco are proudly showing their art at the Cape Cod Cooperative Bank in East Harwich.  You are invited to stop by during bank hours and enjoy their <a href=\"/news/carroll-peter-sivco-art-show-cape-cod-cooperative-bank/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-6603 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news\" id=\"post-6603\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/labor-day-silent-auction-of-vivien-oswells-age-100-art/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"An older woman sitting in front of a painting.\" src=\"/media/archive/22c62af270b7ca2cb8a5223a6a8886e7398150ebf8e72eae5a0918341c2a99fd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/labor-day-silent-auction-of-vivien-oswells-age-100-art/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Labor Day Silent Auction of Vivien Oswell’s (Age 100) Art</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div cl